# Shared Rules And Skills

When creating or updating rules or skills, make them available to Claude, Cursor, and Codex when applicable.

- If adding a Cursor rule, mirror the requirement in `CLAUDE.md`.
- If adding Claude guidance, mirror the requirement in `.cursor/rules/`.
- If creating or updating a skill, ensure Claude, Cursor, and Codex can discover and use it when the workflow applies to all three.
